Third-party material
--------------------

None is bundled yet. When command definitions from the SONiC management
framework (Apache License 2.0, https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-mgmt-framework)
are adapted for cli/, they are listed here with their original copyright notice
and the files they appear in.

The CLI in cli/ follows the general command style common to network devices and
the routing syntax style of FRRouting. It contains no Cisco IOS code or
documentation and no FRRouting (GPL) code or text.
